[l_braz_por.raid_target_name_mine]
£resources_strip|5 §HMina§! em $LOCATION|H$

[l_braz_por.raid_target_name_pathfinder_raid]
Desembarques em $LOCATION|H$

[l_braz_por.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid]
Incursão de sabotagem de minas

[l_braz_por.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid_desc]
Um grupo de paraquedistas é lançado sobre um grande complexo de minas inimigo e tenta detonar explosivos para interromper a produção delas por um longo período.

[l_braz_por.raid_type_pathfinder_raid]
Incursão de desbravadores

[l_braz_por.raid_type_pathfinder_raid_desc]
Um grupo de paraquedistas é lançado atrás das linhas inimigas para preparar uma invasão iminente, destruindo pontes essenciais, armando emboscadas e criando distrações.

[l_english.raid_target_name_mine]
£resources_strip|5 §HMine§! in $LOCATION|H$

[l_english.raid_target_name_pathfinder_raid]
$LOCATION|H$ landings

[l_english.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid]
Mine Sabotage Raid

[l_english.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid_desc]
A team of paratroopers drop on a major enemy mine complex and try to set off charges that will disrupt production for a long time.

[l_english.raid_type_pathfinder_raid]
Pathfinder Raid

[l_english.raid_type_pathfinder_raid_desc]
A team of paratrooper drop behind enemy lines to prepare for an upcoming invasion by destroying critical bridges, setting up ambushes, and generally creating distractions

[l_french.raid_target_name_mine]
£resources_strip|5 §Hmine§! dans : $LOCATION|H$

[l_french.raid_target_name_pathfinder_raid]
Atterrissages dans : $LOCATION|H$

[l_french.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid]
Sabotage de mines

[l_french.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid_desc]
Cette escouade de parachutistes prend d'assaut une mine ennemie pour tenter de la faire exploser, retardant ainsi la production d'une durée indéterminée.

[l_french.raid_type_pathfinder_raid]
Raid de repérage

[l_french.raid_type_pathfinder_raid_desc]
Une escouade de parachutistes se positionne derrière les lignes ennemies pour préparer une invasion en détruisant les ponts ou en organisant des embuscades.

[l_german.raid_target_name_mine]
£resources_strip|5 §HMine§! in $LOCATION|H$

[l_german.raid_target_name_pathfinder_raid]
Landung in $LOCATION|H$

[l_german.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid]
Minensabotageüberfall

[l_german.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid_desc]
Eine Fallschirmjäger-Staffel wird über einem feindlichen Minenkomplex abgeworfen, wo sie versucht, Sprengladungen anzubringen, um die Produktion für einen längeren Zeitraum zu unterbrechen.

[l_german.raid_type_pathfinder_raid]
Pfadfinderüberfall

[l_german.raid_type_pathfinder_raid_desc]
Eine Fallschirmjäger-Staffel wird hinter den feindlichen Linien abgeworfen, wo sie wichtige Brücken zerstört, Hinterhalte legt und allgemein für Ablenkung sorgt, um die bevorstehende Invasion vorzubereiten.

[l_japanese.raid_target_name_mine]
£resources_strip|5 $LOCATION|H$に§H鉱山§!

[l_japanese.raid_target_name_pathfinder_raid]
$LOCATION|H$着陸

[l_japanese.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid]
採掘場破壊

[l_japanese.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid_desc]
空挺部隊のチームが、主要な敵の鉱山施設に降下し、長期間にわたって生産を滞らせる爆発を仕掛ける。

[l_japanese.raid_type_pathfinder_raid]
パスファインダー襲撃

[l_japanese.raid_type_pathfinder_raid_desc]
敵陣の後方に降下した空挺部隊のチームは、重要な橋の破壊、待ち伏せの準備、そして注意をそらすことによって、予定されている侵攻に備える。

[l_korean.raid_target_name_mine]
£resources_strip|5  $LOCATION|H$ §H광산§!

[l_korean.raid_target_name_pathfinder_raid]
$LOCATION|H$ 강하

[l_korean.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid]
광산 사보타주 습격

[l_korean.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid_desc]
공수부대를 적의 주요 광산 단지에 투입합니다. 이들은 폭발물을 통해 생산을 장기간 방해하려 시도할 것입니다.

[l_korean.raid_type_pathfinder_raid]
항로유도단 습격

[l_korean.raid_type_pathfinder_raid_desc]
공수부대를 적의 후방에 강하시켜 중요한 교각을 파괴하고, 매복을 준비하는 등 전반적으로 혼란을 조성하며 곧 있을 공격을 준비합니다.

[l_polish.raid_target_name_mine]
£resources_strip|5 §HKopalnia§! w: $LOCATION|H$

[l_polish.raid_target_name_pathfinder_raid]
Desant: $LOCATION|H$

[l_polish.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid]
Uderzenie sabotażowe (kopalnia)

[l_polish.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid_desc]
Oddział spadochroniarzy wyląduje w dużym kompleksie kopalnianym wroga i podejmie próbę zdetonowania ładunków wybuchowych, które na długi czas zakłócą produkcję.

[l_polish.raid_type_pathfinder_raid]
Rajd grupy rozpoznawczej

[l_polish.raid_type_pathfinder_raid_desc]
Oddział spadochroniarzy wyląduje na tyłach wroga i podejmie działania przygotowawcze do inwazji, takie jak niszczenie ważnych mostów, organizowanie zasadzek oraz ogólne sianie zamętu.

[l_russian.raid_target_name_mine]
£resources_strip|5 §HШахта§! в регионе $LOCATION|H$

[l_russian.raid_target_name_pathfinder_raid]
Места высадки в регионе $LOCATION|H$

[l_russian.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid]
Налет с саботажем шахт

[l_russian.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid_desc]
Отряд парашютистов высадится у крупного вражеского горнорудного комплекса и попытается взорвать оборудование, чтобы надолго остановить производство.

[l_russian.raid_type_pathfinder_raid]
Рейд наведения

[l_russian.raid_type_pathfinder_raid_desc]
Группа десантников высаживается за линию фронта, чтобы подготовить почву к предстоящему вторжению. Они уничтожают важные мосты, устраивают засады и отвлекают противника различными способами.

[l_simp_chinese.raid_target_name_mine]
$LOCATION|H$的£resources_strip|5 §H矿§!

[l_simp_chinese.raid_target_name_pathfinder_raid]
$LOCATION|H$登陆点

[l_simp_chinese.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid]
矿场破坏袭击

[l_simp_chinese.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid_desc]
一队空降兵空降到敌方重要矿区，尝试引爆炸药以长期破坏生产。

[l_simp_chinese.raid_type_pathfinder_raid]
前锋突袭

[l_simp_chinese.raid_type_pathfinder_raid_desc]
一队空降兵空降到敌后，破坏重要桥梁、设置伏击点并制造混乱，为即将到来的入侵做好准备。

[l_spanish.raid_target_name_mine]
£resources_strip|5 §HMina(s)§! en $LOCATION|H$

[l_spanish.raid_target_name_pathfinder_raid]
$LOCATION|H$ aterrizajes

[l_spanish.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid]
Asalto y sabotaje de minas

[l_spanish.raid_type_mine_sabotage_raid_desc]
Un equipo de paracaidistas se deja caer sobre un importante complejo minero enemigo e intenta detonar cargas que detendrán la producción durante mucho tiempo.

[l_spanish.raid_type_pathfinder_raid]
Asalto con paracaidistas

[l_spanish.raid_type_pathfinder_raid_desc]
Un equipo de paracaidistas se lanza tras las líneas enemigas y prepara para la posterior invasión destruyendo puentes importantes, tendiendo emboscadas y creando distracciones.
